OL,3,GNEWSAArrests over alleged racial abuse
OL,4,Aof Asian man
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested after an
OL,7,FAsian man was allegedly surrounded and
OL,8,Fracially abused in Leeds city centre.
OL,10,FThe incident took place at about 00:50
OL,11,FBST on Saturday and West Yorkshire
OL,12,FPolice said there had also been reports
OL,13,Fthe three men had been kicked out of
OL,14,Fthe Stick and Twist pub in Merrion Way
OL,15,Fshortly before for doing a Nazi salute.
OL,17,FThe force said the three men, aged 25,
OL,18,F26 and 29, were arrested on suspicion
OL,19,Fof racially aggravated public order and
OL,20,Ftaken into custody.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
